      <details class="fq-item"><summary class="fq-q">How does Ginger+ ease nausea?<span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="fq-a">Standardised ginger extract and active <strong>Vit. B<sub>6</sub> (P5P)</strong> are the two most evidence-backed pregnancy-nausea supports — together in one gentle daily capsule.</div></details>
