</section>


<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Gentle care for the days that <em>need it most.</em></h2>
    <p>Ease the mornings, support digestion and calm — backed by science, gentle every single day.</p>
    <a href="#buy" class="final-cta">
      Start your Ginger+ routine
